1
00:00:01,110 --> 00:00:03,980
Now let us examine Amazon platform fees.

2
00:00:04,170 --> 00:00:05,898
First is the referral fee.

3
00:00:05,910 --> 00:00:07,400
This is the selling commission.

4
00:00:07,650 --> 00:00:10,280
Under Amazon US selling-fee rules

5
00:00:10,410 --> 00:00:13,700
referral rates differ by category.

6
00:00:13,890 --> 00:00:15,558
For example, Home & Kitchen

7
00:00:15,570 --> 00:00:18,380
typically uses a 15% referral rate.

8
00:00:18,510 --> 00:00:21,380
Computers and consumer electronics

9
00:00:21,450 --> 00:00:23,960
may use an 8% rate.

10
00:00:24,210 --> 00:00:26,118
For our scenario, assume a seller

11
00:00:26,130 --> 00:00:30,200
in Home & Kitchen with a 15% referral rate.

12
00:00:30,510 --> 00:00:32,478
On $100,000 of revenue

13
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:35,420
the referral fee is $15,000.

14
00:00:35,550 --> 00:00:36,620
That is not the end.

15
00:00:36,810 --> 00:00:38,538
If the seller uses FBA

16
00:00:38,550 --> 00:00:41,840
Amazon handles storage and order fulfillment.

17
00:00:41,910 --> 00:00:45,020
There is also an FBA fulfillment fee.

18
00:00:45,090 --> 00:00:46,880
That is the cost of fulfilling orders.

19
00:00:47,850 --> 00:00:49,758
This fee is not simply calculated

20
00:00:49,770 --> 00:00:52,400
as a fixed percentage of sales.

21
00:00:52,530 --> 00:00:55,158
It generally depends on dimensions, weight

22
00:00:55,170 --> 00:00:57,440
and the applicable fee schedule.

23
00:00:57,750 --> 00:01:00,320
Consider two products both priced at $20.

24
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:02,178
One is small and light.

25
00:01:02,190 --> 00:01:03,978
The other is large and heavy.

26
00:01:03,990 --> 00:01:06,320
Their fulfillment costs can differ substantially.

27
00:01:06,690 --> 00:01:10,278
Assume this seller's monthly FBA fulfillment costs

28
00:01:10,290 --> 00:01:11,660
total $18,000.

29
00:01:11,790 --> 00:01:13,940
The $15,000 referral fee

30
00:01:14,130 --> 00:01:16,758
plus $18,000 in fulfillment fees

31
00:01:16,770 --> 00:01:18,860
comes to $33,000.

32
00:01:19,110 --> 00:01:21,138
We had $73,000 remaining.

33
00:01:21,150 --> 00:01:23,058
Subtract $33,000.

34
00:01:23,070 --> 00:01:25,100
The balance is now $40,000.
